-- SAFE IN PRODUCTION. This file never drops a table, never drops a column,
-- and never deletes row data. It brings any database in line with the
-- rulebook that shipped in this same commit.
--
-- Views, calc_*/get_* functions and RLS policies hold NO data: they are a
-- pure function of the rulebook. They are dropped and recreated here rather
-- than migrated. Do NOT hand-write a migration that recreates a view or a
-- calc_* function — re-run this file instead.
