-- ============================================================================
-- GENERATED FILE — DO NOT EDIT. Rewritten by every `effortless build`.
--
-- SOURCE OF TRUTH: effortless-rulebook/effortless-rulebook.json
-- Every table below is defined there. To add a table, a column, or a
-- calculated field, edit the rulebook and rebuild — never this file, and
-- never a *b-customize-*.sql file. A table defined outside the rulebook
-- gets no view, no calculated fields, no RuleSpeak and no Explainer DAG.
